### Feedback for a well attended session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/1/feedback
Accept: application/json

### Feedback for the last slot of the day
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/41/feedback
Accept: application/json

### Add a rating
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/1/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attendeeEmail": "{{attendeeEmail}}",
  "rating": 5,
  "comments": "Best ninety minutes of my week."
}

### Add an invalid rating - the API should refuse this
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/1/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attendeeEmail": "not-an-email",
  "rating": 9,
  "comments": "Out of range on purpose."
}
